# The live copies on the server are LF. Pinning LF here keeps `cmp` against a
# file downloaded over FTP meaningful; without it a checkout on Windows would
# rewrite every file to CRLF and every comparison would report a phantom diff.
*.php text eol=lf
*.htaccess text eol=lf
.htaccess text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
